{"id":223483934929332,"type":"album","name":"Virgins","artist":"Tim Hecker","year":2013,"weight":21,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/2013/8679-virgins.jpg","aoty":83,"aoty_user":85,"sputnik":4.11,"yt":"YzjLq2AoWv8","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/tim-hecker/virgins","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/8679-tim-hecker-virgins.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/138108/Tim-Hecker-Virgins/"},"desc":"Virgins was recorded during three periods in 2012, mostly in Reykjavík, Montréal and Seattle, using ensembles in live performance. The sound palette of this work is wider, almost 'percussive' and tighter sounding than previous works. While this album remains committed to a painterly form of musical abstraction, it is also a record of restrained composition recorded live primarily in intimate studio rooms. This record employs woodwinds, piano and synthesizers towards an effort at doing what digital music does not do naturally — making music that is out of time, out of tune and out of phase. This follow-up to his ."},"artist_ref":{"id":2538968163177,"name":"Tim Hecker","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tim_Hecker_-_A-Visions_4_%284690826583%29.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":255263121494129,"type":"genre","name":"Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3474,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":87625349211221,"type":"genre","name":"electronic","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1332,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":54532248910369,"type":"genre","name":"Electroacoustic","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":216,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":224665640696482,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Electroacoustic","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":1,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":137629407618220,"name":"RYM Top — Ambient","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":8,"year"